$date 2026-11-12T11:20:11 $end
$version fda debug_core (brief 50A) $end
$comment Capture count and duty when either win_wr or press_clear goes to 1, 8 cycles before and 64 after. To make it happen, wait 300 ms and then write 0x22 to DUTY. $end
$timescale 10000 ps $end
$scope module capture $end
$var wire 1 ! win_wr $end
$var wire 1 " press_clear $end
$var wire 16 # count $end
$var wire 8 $ duty $end
$var wire 1 % TRIGGER $end
$upscope $end
$enddefinitions $end
#0
0!
0"
b0 #
b1000000 $
0%
#8
1!
1%
#9
0!
b100010 $
0%
